{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19255","headline":"送周鲁儒赴举诗 · 刘禹锡","name":"送周鲁儒赴举诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宋日营阳内史孙，因家占得九疑村。\n童心便有爱书癖，手指今余把笔痕。\n自握蛇珠辞白屋，欲凭鸡卜谒金门。\n若逢广坐问羊酪，从此知名在一言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}